tabforge-guitar.onnx is a modified version of Spotify's Basic Pitch model
(Copyright 2022 Spotify AB, Apache License 2.0, see LICENSE-basic-pitch).

Changes made by TabForge: the network weights were fine-tuned and a
string-classification head was added. See training/ in this repository.

Training data:
- GuitarSet (Xi, Bittner, Pauwels, Ye, Bello; ISMIR 2018), CC BY 4.0.
  https://zenodo.org/records/3371780
- IDMT-SMT-Guitar (Kehling, Abeßer, Dittmar, Schuller; Fraunhofer IDMT),
  CC BY-NC-ND 4.0. https://zenodo.org/records/7544110
  Because of this dataset, the model is used for non-commercial purposes only.
- Synthetic riffs generated by training/synth_riffs.py.
